        "liquidationMechanism": "When a Vault becomes unsafe under its ilk's safety-adjusted Spot value, Dog.bark confiscates the position, assigns its debt to Vow, and promptly starts that ilk's Clipper Dutch auction; auction price decreases over time and can be reset under per-ilk parameters.",
